  every layout in that template places top-left at 0.45in from the corner).

  Converted EMF -> SVG with `emf2svg-conv` (brew: libemf2svg) since macOS has
  no native EMF reader - path data below is that converter's output,
  untouched except merging the per-path fill/stroke into one <g fill>
