  visual difference - every path already has fill == that stroke color).

  This replaces trying to reproduce the mark via the 'Muni' font + CSS
  letter-spacing (Erik flagged that version as visibly wrong) - real vector
  paths mean it's pixel-accurate regardless of whether the Muni font is
  installed anywhere.
-->
